IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `fp-claims`

-- Family Provision Act 1972 (WA), ss 4, 6, 7A, 7, 14(2), 19, 20(4), (5) -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_wa_family-provision-act-1972_baseline.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

-- Life facts are from the workbench scenarios au/wa/cradle-to-grave-{daniel,jake}/facts.json: Daniel dies 21 October 2078,
-- married to Priya, children Anjali and Luca, sister Sofia; Graham dies 19 August 2052, his will giving everything to Sue;
-- Jake (his son) and Ruby (Jake's daughter) survive him; Jake dies intestate on 18 April 2079, divorced from Tahlia since
-- 20 August 2039. HYPOTHETICAL: the grant of probate of Graham's will on 14 October 2052; a prescribed amount for
-- s 7(1)(eb) of $500,000 (the regulation is not deposited); the size of Daniel's estate; every other date not named above.

