§ `s 7(1) -- d085: may Daniel's family claim against his will (a third to the Foundation)?`

#ASSERT `May I claim against the estate` `Priya, Daniel's wife` (Date 21 10 2078) 500000 EQUALS `yes: I am a person by whom an application may be made (s 7(1))`
#ASSERT `May I claim against the estate` `Luca, Daniel's son` (Date 21 10 2078) 500000 EQUALS `yes: I am a person by whom an application may be made (s 7(1))`
#ASSERT `May I claim against the estate` `Sofia, Daniel's sister` (Date 21 10 2078) 500000 EQUALS `no: I am not in any class that section 7(1) names`

